WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.700
- So we're going to talk
about your movie in a minute.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.820
I swear cause that was really good.

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.900
Obviously, I messed up my intro,

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.044
but while we're on the
subject of your home life,

00:00:08.044 --> 00:00:10.730
is it true that you have like
a dozen animals like horses or

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.059
you have like a lot of animals, right?

00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:12.892
- I have a lot of animals, yeah.

00:00:12.892 --> 00:00:13.725
- [Kelly] I love animals.

00:00:13.725 --> 00:00:15.557
- Yeah, well come over anytime.

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:18.300
I have nine horses, five
dogs, eight chickens,

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.680
two bunnies and lots of wildlife.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.180
Yeah. There's Bella with a horsey.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.110
- [Kelly] Oh my Gosh.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:25.970
- [Alyssa] And also my brother
just called me yesterday

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:29.097
and asked if I would take a mini horse,

00:00:29.097 --> 00:00:32.210
which I haven't talked
to my husband about yet.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:35.610
So I'm going to just take this
opportunity to let him know.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:36.460
(laughter)

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.984
Wait where is the camera?
Which camera, which camera?

00:00:38.984 --> 00:00:39.817
- Is he not into all the animals as you?

00:00:39.817 --> 00:00:40.650
- He's not so into the animals.

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:43.180
- Okay. Go. It's right there. Go for it.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.033
- Hi Dave.

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:46.423
We're adopting a mini horse.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:49.793
So you know, it comes tomorrow.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:51.963
- And Dave,

00:00:51.963 --> 00:00:54.090
if you don't like the horse
we're going to know if the horse

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:56.100
doesn't make it at your
house, it was you all along.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.110
That didn't want the horse.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:59.530
So now you have it, the pressure's on.

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:02.280
I love that though, because
I love animals so much.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:03.770
I think it's so good around kids too.

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:05.970
Just like the respect that
comes with it and taking

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.490
care of them and like
selflessness. It's so important,

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:09.910
but I have rabbits too.

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:12.050
And during Christmas it rained
so hard here that they dug

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:13.580
tunnels to each other.

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:15.070
And now, Alyssa...

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:16.400
- [Alyssa] There's lots of rabbits.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.230
- They're about to be
born and I'm terrified.

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:21.250
So if anybody wants a Holland Lop...

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:24.358
- Dave, Dave. We're taking some rabbits.

00:01:24.358 --> 00:01:25.840
(laughter)

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:30.140
- Dave, do you want a very
cute Holland Lop baby rabbit?

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.240
I was like, I didn't get them
fixed cause usually I do.

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:34.430
I listen to, you know, Bob and I was

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:35.930
get all your pets spayed and neutered,

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:37.600
but they weren't together
so I didn't do it.

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.677
And because I was like, I
don't want to make them go

00:01:39.677 --> 00:01:41.230
into surgery if they
don't have to... they dug.

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:42.640
And I was like, you know
what? You earned it.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:44.405
- Wow. Yeah.

00:01:44.405 --> 00:01:46.700
- You dug, you earned
it, earned that moment.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:50.753
Dug to each other twice!
Anyway a lot of bunnies.

